WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.620
- During the Winter School,

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.180
it'll be a series of different sessions.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.950
Some of them will be plenary talks

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.930
speaking about different aspects

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:08.640
of the science of consciousness.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.890
But there'll also be some social events

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.560
so you get to interact
with leading researchers.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.360
Leading consciousness researchers.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.630
- It's a unique opportunity
for young scientists

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:23.580
to get engaged with people
they've read their papers of.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.220
We've all had this
experience as scientists

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.410
of actually meeting for the first time

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.090
one of the people we admire

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.820
or one of the people we just agree with

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.610
or one of the people
who influenced our work.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.050
- People get divided into teams

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.580
that become these little communities

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.320
and they get to work on projects.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.950
And they have a lot of time
outside of just lecture time

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.550
to interact both socially
and scientifically.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:51.180
And I think that really builds
relationships that last.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:54.450
- And at the end of it, I
think you'll come away equipped

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.280
with a whole lot of skills and experience

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.160
that will be really valuable
in your academic career

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.673
or in fact in whatever
you want to be next.

00:01:01.673 --> 00:01:04.256
(bright music)

